/* Footer under Check links periodically in Settings > General. */
"Once a day while Library is open, Library quickly checks that each bookmark’s page is still there. It doesn’t download the page. If a site doesn’t answer that quick check, Library loads the page and reads only its first 64 KB. Each bookmark is checked at most once a day. Bookmarks whose page is missing or can’t be reached show a warning in Edit Library. Off by default. Choose Check Links in the File menu to check now." = "Once a day while Library is open, Library quickly checks that each bookmark’s page is still there. It doesn’t download the page. If a site doesn’t answer that quick check, Library loads the page and reads only its first 64 KB. Each bookmark is checked at most once a day. Bookmarks whose page is missing or can’t be reached show a warning in Edit Library. Off by default. Choose Check Links in the File menu to check now.";
